---
title: "x_oracle::refresh_usd_price (Current Finance: Oracle)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_load_feed: load pyth_feed_infos for CoinType
    q_load_feed --> q_assert_object: assert_pyth_price_info_object(price_info_object)
    q_assert_object --> q_get_price: pyth_adaptor::get_pyth_price(price_info_object, feed_data, clock)
    q_get_price --> q_update: returns (ema, spot) price components
    q_update --> q_check_exists: base_token_prices.contains(coin_type)?
    q_check_exists --> q_add_new: not exists
    q_check_exists --> q_update_existing: exists
    q_add_new --> [*]: price_feed::new(spot, ema), prices.add()
    q_update_existing --> [*]: feed.set(spot, ema)

    note right of q_get_price
        INV-001: price_info_object must match registered feed for coin type
        INV-002: both EMA and spot prices updated atomically
        INV-003: price_delay_tolerance_ms enforced (default 5s, max 1800s)
        INV-004: EMA vs spot difference checked during borrow/withdraw (tolerance_bps)
    end note
